// TEST: a generic logical not called with an integer (rejects)
// ============================================================================
// The numbers-only rule's mirror (formalism 2.4; lead ruling 2026-11-14): the
// logical operators take Bools only, as `if 1 then ..` already did (BL3001).
// On master 1e6a871a this type-checked:
// each instance is judged at its call (GOBoolOperand).
// ============================================================================
function notf(x) = !x
let a = notf(true)
let b = notf(1)
// ERROR: BL3001
